{"t":"Swamp Fever World Change","s":"swamp-fever-world-change-b2985","k":"quest","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Swamp Fever World Change</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(8 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Changes\">World Change</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>The easily treatable swamp fever afflicts only the poorest of Venore, but the cure can be found nearby.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll\">Swamp Trolls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Feverish%20Citizen\">Feverish Citizens</a>. Possibly <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bats</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime\">Slimes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Centipede\">Centipedes</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Potential to obtain <a href=\"#/wiki/Slug%20Drug\">Slug Drug</a> and some <a href=\"#/quest/afflicted-outfits-quest\">strange pieces of cloth</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\nFind <a href=\"#/wiki/Ottokar\">Ottokar</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>'s poor house <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32880,32117,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32880, 32117, 7)</a>. Go out the south-west exit and walk east below the bridge, then north along the path.\n</p><p>He will inform you about his fight against Swamp Fever. Only the poorest of Venore get the disease, but the cure is not hard to obtain.\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Feverish%20Citizen\">Feverish Citizens</a> may appear throughout Venore and may attack you - they suffer from Swamp Fever (spawn time can be either thirty minutes or an hour and more depending on the amount of <a href=\"#/wiki/Medicine%20Pouch\">Medicine Pouches</a> given to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ottokar\">Ottokar</a>). If you kill them, they may drop certain pieces of cloth needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/afflicted-outfits-quest\">Afflicted Outfits Quest</a>.\n</p><p>In order to prevent the fever from spreading a certain number of <a href=\"#/wiki/Medicine%20Pouch\">Medicine Pouches</a> must be given to Ottokar each day. You can go south of Venore to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll%20Cave\">Swamp Troll Cave</a> and hunt them for these medicine bags. You could also go to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope%20Swamp%20Trolls\">Port Hope Swamp Trolls</a>. In exchange for <a href=\"#/wiki/Medicine%20Pouch\">Medicine Pouches</a>, he will give you the <a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased\">Belongings of a Deceased</a> patient. These bags may contain a number of things, including <a href=\"#/wiki/Slug%20Drug\">Slug Drug</a>, which can be used to <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiger%20Slug\">tame</a> wild <a href=\"#/wiki/Slug\">Slugs</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["afflicted-outfits-quest"]}